Package: RSwissPos
Title: Collect data on Swiss direct democracy
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: 
    person("Maxime", "Walder", , "maxime.walder@unige.ch", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4753-2090"))
Description: Gives easy access to latest version of data sets on Swiss direct democracy to measure Swiss parties and population ideological positions based on a peer-reviewed article published in the Swiss Political Science Review.
